,[29334,40.6,2001,76,84,20],[29335,50.3,2001,74,89,20]],"links":[["Grafton County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-hampshire/grafton-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grafton County","/arc-plc/new-hampshire/grafton-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 36% of normal in July to August and 47% in August to September. Grid 28431 had its driest year in 1963, at 67% of normal.</p>"}
